                "quoted_status_profile_username": "Phil_Lewis_",
                "reply_count": 18,
                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "You can't choose when you get sick and oftentimes hospitals don\u2019t tell you the true cost of care up front. Medical debt can make it hard to buy a car or take out a loan. It\u2019s unfair for a lower credit score to follow you for years because you suffered an accident and needed care.",
