                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 788,
                "retweet_count": 297,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Go ahead and ask Americans if they can afford a 70% hike in their health insurance premiums right now. See how that goes.\n\nIt\u2019s a crisis in the making that we\u2019re TRYING to avoid, but Trump is refusing to meet with us.",
