                "quoted_status_profile_username": "SenWarren",
                "reply_count": 201,
                "retweet_count": 227,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Can think of a lot of hospitals, schools and food pantries that could use twenty billion dollars to actually help our own citizens\u2026",
