                "quoted_status_profile_username": "RepFine",
                "reply_count": 2096,
                "retweet_count": 1423,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Undocumented immigrants aren\u2019t even *allowed* to access Medicare, Medicaid or ACA credits.\n\nRepublicans like Randy are going to spike your health insurance premiums, but they REALLY want you to blame an immigrant instead.",
